  "description": "A default, optional caseworker worklist surface — server-rendered GOV.UK markup for the filter/sort/search/paginated list (see docs/guides/queue-worklist-filtering.md), an item review page, advance, and per-cursor pickup/putback (see docs/guides/work-allocation.md). A host wires it up with AddWorklist()/MapWorklist(prefix), supplying only tenant/actor resolution and its own page chrome — or ignores this package entirely and hand-writes the same routes itself, as Wayfinder.ReferenceApp originally did.",
